<h2 id="about-data">About the data</h2>

<p>The street network is extracted from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org">OpenStreetMap</a>. The public transport data are provided by networks that provide their timetables as open data. Some data improvements are achieved by Hove based on <a href="https://transport.data.gouv.fr/">https://transport.data.gouv.fr/</a>.</p>
